        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "h. Time spent by the recipient on donated hardship leave shall not count toward completion of the employee's initial trial service period, nor towards salary eligibility dates for a step increase. When the recipient is released to return to duty, the end of the initial trial service and salary eligibility date will be adjusted by the period of the donated hardship leave taken.",
            "block_bbox": [
